    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Silktrails</i>, a delightful hand-drawn adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Unique Levels</strong>: Explore diverse, hand-drawn environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Hidden Cats</strong>: Engage in the fun of finding over 60 hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by &quot;Silkgrove&quot;</strong>: Created by the minds behind <i>Silkgrove</i>, this game extends the charming universe of the solarpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Gameplay</strong>: Ideal for cat enthusiasts and fans of gentle, immersive adventures.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Silktrails</i>, a delightful hand-drawn adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Unique Levels</strong>: Explore diverse, hand-drawn environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Hidden Cats</strong>: Engage in the fun of finding over 60 hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by &quot;Silkgrove&quot;</strong>: Created by the minds behind <i>Silkgrove</i>, this game extends the charming universe of the solarpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Gameplay</strong>: Ideal for cat enthusiasts and fans of gentle, immersive adventures.</p></li></ul>",
